      value.sourceSha256===sourceSha256&&value.requestSha256===digest(encoded(request))&&
      HEX.test(value.nativeRecordSha256??'')&&Number.isFinite(Date.parse(value.capturedAt)),
    'RESEARCH_OBJECT_PREPARATION_CHANGED');
